  "tests": [
    "forward install preserves existing Auth/profile/Storage/staff and business-access rows and buckets",
    "reviewable preflight/postflight metadata enforces private helpers and authenticated RPC grants",
    "all workflow records and access hashes deny direct app and service reads",
    "anonymous, stale, expired and substituted sessions cannot read or write workflows",
    "session-bound roles reject support access and do not accept a claimed role",
    "expected owner checks reject account switching before a command is recorded",
    "assignment create/update is tenant scoped, versioned and idempotent",
    "foreign assignees, foreign drafts and unknown fields cannot become an assignment",
    "submission requires actual draft, confirmed rights and visible sponsored disclosure",
    "editor submission requires an independent owner/admin review and locks the approved creative",
    "review feedback and submitter withdrawal restore editable state without losing history",
    "approved scheduling updates the actual publishing queue and blocks early direct publication",
    "expired rights and pre-embargo schedules cannot enter the publishing queue",
    "direct Planner scheduling and deletion cannot bypass a pending approval",
    "a rejected source cannot escape approval by being unlinked from its assignment",
    "cursor pages are bounded and stable and never repeat the prior cursor row",
    "partnership drafts remain private until an authorized owner/admin proposes them",
    "only the named creator can accept and submit a deliverable",
    "a business cannot grant creator publishing or paid-promotion permission to itself",
    "publishing and paid-promotion consents are separate, bounded, version-specific and revocable",
    "creator feedback creates a new deliverable version and clears prior review state",
    "approval does not activate an ad, publish a post, or create financial transactions",
    "team roles cannot be changed through direct Data API updates or code creation bypasses",
    "same-name member creation changes only the new identity and never returns stored code hashes",
    "a business must bootstrap its first owner explicitly and binds the creating session",
    "last-owner protection prevents demotion, deactivation and empty-team privilege fallback",
    "revocation removes session membership and prevents successful command receipt replay",
    "device management requires a live administrative member and preserves a removed registration",
    "newsroom detail returns the exact linked creative independently of latest Planner pagination",
    "partnership lists are bounded while participant detail retains revision and review history",
    "a blocked creator can withdraw or revoke consent but new consent and deliverables stop",
    "new team clients fence the expected business atomically before code creation",
    "the actual due publisher creates the approved post once and rejects duplicate worker delivery",
    "creator consent applies to the submitted source and becomes ineffective after that post changes or disappears",
    "creator review covers media edits, alternate text and legacy media while engagement counters stay outside the creative",
    "member binding updates the selected identity without a share-to-update lock upgrade",
    "every actual static web root is unavailable as a new username and guarded on direct profile writes",
    "route reservations cover mixed case and whitespace, keep null Auth onboarding intact and do not rename unchanged handles",
    "route reservation helpers are not callable and anonymous availability is pinned to a safe search path",
    "business provisioning rejects reserved route usernames before reserving or creating any identity",
    "a pending legacy reservation for a web route aborts the provision guard migration for review"
